Third-party credit
------------------
This project builds on github.com/jamesbraid/unifi-emu (MIT License,
Copyright (c) James Braid): its `inform` package provides the UniFi inform
wire format, crypto and packet handling as a dependency, its model catalogue
and capability bitmaps are used at build time, and internal/device is a fork
of its inform session and tables (see the package documentation there). Its
docs/PROTOCOL.md was the starting point for docs/protocol-connection-points.md.
